<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Feb '97 retail sales rise 1.0 pct vs Jan.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Feb '97 retail sales rise 1.0 pct vs Jan.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office</p>
<p>reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV RETAIL SALES	FEB 97	 JAN 97	 FEB 96</p>
<p> pct change mth/mth	  +  1.0	 - 19.0	 + 12.0</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	    + 26.0	 + 35.0	 +140.0</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (JAN TO FEB)</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	    + 30.0	 + 35.0	 +138.0</p>
<p>NOTES -- Data exclude private sector. Data Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro.</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 222 4305</p>
</text>
